VERSION 1.0
Date: 2026-05-16
Status: Released

Changelog:
- Initial release of EPUB local generation tool
- Web interface with Flask (generation + probe tool tabs)
- Catalog parser with CSS selector support and auto chapter number sorting
- Chapter fetcher with HTML cleaning, title extraction (priority: <title> > <h1> > fallback), title cleanup
- EPUB 3 builder via ebooklib with TOC navigation
- Multi-threaded chapter fetching with progress tracking
- Probe/detection tool for finding CSS selectors
- Title extraction fix: prefer <title> over site logo <h1>
- Sort fix: chapters ordered by catalog sequence after parallel fetch
